<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers opened steady. Trading moderarely active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1350 lbs 64.50-66.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  Few High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1125 lbs 64.00-64.50, individual 65.00.</p>
